{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_04",
  "title": "Kebab & Prophecy",
  "storyCode": "DT-4",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b838a76ae25ed1ec08b0f8db7ace90bbb6f27ee32c2ec360763d0c7f8dc2f7fa",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gah—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're awake."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Who are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Call me Arges."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I foresaw an accident in the forest today, so I decided to patrol the area, where I found you unconscious in the snow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Have you seen my companions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Tch, I should go look for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gah—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're quite injured. You should rest here first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't seem to be from Sami."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...My friends and I were looking for a way home, and a guy called Oakcup told us Sami's will was guiding us to go north."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oakcup... the oak-child."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've heard that in Sami the name is synonymous with 'wisdom.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Wisdom'...? Then... Do you know of the Cyclopes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...What's wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have witnessed many ensnared by misfortune. Death itself... is no stranger to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yet, why do I see so many deaths in you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No sign of Chilchuck?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We should at least be glad for the thick snow and trees here. He should have handled that fall easily."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm... but he isn't the greatest at self-defense, so we should still find him as fast as we can."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It'll be terrible if he ran into that hornbeast from earlier."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aye. But we have another problem—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh*...It's not your fault."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But what are you doing all by yourself in this forest, miss?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm hunting..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you live here, lass?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nope, I live on Rhodes Island!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "RHODES ISLAND?! That's the place we've been looking for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh? You wanna go to Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah, we're trying to find our way home, and someone told us we could get help there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You lost your home? So sad..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So can you take us to Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eh... But I don't wanna go back yet..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Cause I'm still hungry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is that all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then if we feed you till you're satisfied, will you take us there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm, sure!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I didn't expect to find a lead like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Could this be what Sami was guiding us towards all along?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I still haven't found my prey."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We have our own food—Ah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Guess we lost it all in the chaos earlier."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...How about this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "First, you help us find our companion. Then, we'll help you hunt whatever you want. And finally, you take us to Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm! Okay!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What an innocent lass. What's your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm Ceobe, but you can call me Kay!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You saw death in me...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Many deaths, in fact. Both in the past and the future, yet here you stand now, alive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That Oakcup guy said Cyclopes can see the future."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you one of them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then please, tell me my fate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Cyclopes can only see doom."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's fine. Just tell me the fates of me and my companions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your companions walk toward the endless icefields..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, they do not go of their own will. They were... swallowed up, by the dark and the void."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's that mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They were corrupted by demons."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Demons?! No one mentioned any demons!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Demons... are a vagrant existence on this land."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They corrode and envelop all that they touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Corrupted creatures lose all sense of self, as if swallowed into the void—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Those creatures have a circle on their faces..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just like a single eye on a head."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you already seen a corrupted creature?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chilchuck ponders for a moment before pressing his hand on his injured arm and exiting the cave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can a doom you see be avoided?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arges",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All I can say is that I try."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chilchuck",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Then so will I."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So you're saying Rhodes Island is a giant ship?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah! It's huuuge and it goes everywhere!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, so that's why we never found it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sniff*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Smells like blood. My prey's blood. The one-eyed monster is nearby!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Senshi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What a keen sense of smell."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm? Kay, did you just say 'one-eyed monster'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah. A hornbeast with only one eye on its face. So a 'one-eyed monster,' right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eek... do you guys still remember what Oakcup said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "About the Cyclopes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Could he have guessed wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe Sami didn't mean for us to find an actual Cyclops."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe It just predicted we would find Kay, and knew we would encounter a 'hornbeast' like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Either way, since we've run into it again..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'll just have to deal with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is it dead?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laios",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Marcille",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Phew... Then I guess we can consider Chilchuck avenged."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
